| `TestCase.Id` changed — Azure DevOps history may reset | No code fix; history re-baselines |
| `TreatDiscoveryWarningsAsErrors` now `true` | Fix discovery warnings or set to `false` in `.runsettings` |
| Analyzer severities upgraded | Review new warnings |

### 5. Verify

1. `dotnet build` — zero errors
2. `dotnet test` — all tests pass, compare pass/fail counts to baseline

